5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our selection is grounded in operational reality, I would like to examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm ready to do this. I want to see if we're just repeating old mistakes, so I'll look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we must understand the hidden variables that cause delays. I will examine the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think it's important to know the real costs... not just the totals. I'll look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! I want to solve the mystery of where the time actually goes, so I'll check the journey audits on where minutes go and the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I believe we have a very comprehensive set of investigations planned. By looking at both the financial ledgers and the human operational side, we can avoid making promises that the network cannot actually keep.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I agree, but we can't just look at the now. If we don't check what failed in the past, we're just guessing. I'm going to make sure we don't fall for the same old traps.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Past failures are useful, but the most dangerous obstacles are often those that are not documented in the plans. I am interested in the administrative and structural frictions that remain invisible until they cause a stall.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with everyone. I just hope that by looking at the ledgers, we can find a way to be honest about the long-term costs so nobody has to argue about the money later.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds like a plan, Daisuke! I bet the numbers will tell us some secrets! I just want to make sure we're fixing the parts that actually make people late, not just the parts that sound scary!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Sakura. It is easy to be swayed by the scale of a project, but the true measure of success is whether the daily operation can sustain it without breaking the staff.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Exactly! But you can't know if it'll break the staff unless you see how it broke them last time. I'm not letting us ignore the history just because a new plan looks shiny.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"History provides a baseline, but it does not always predict the current friction. I believe the most critical risks are the ones hidden in the bureaucracy and the physical foundations of the city.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think you're all right. I'm just worried that if we don't understand the actual payment structures, the best plan might get rejected because of a budget fight. I'll do my best to find that out.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"You're so thoughtful, Daisuke! I'll be the detective for the passengers! I'm going to find out if the crowds are actually as big as everyone says or if it's just a big misunderstanding!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we have a balanced approach. I am satisfied with our division of labor and look forward to seeing how these different perspectives intersect. I am ready to proceed to the findings.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready too! Let's just make sure we actually listen to what the old records say when we get back. I'll see you all in the next round!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I concur. We have a clear plan of action. I shall await the revelations of the records to see where the true obstacles lie. I am ready.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm ready too. I hope the information I find is helpful for everyone. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm going to go hunt for clues now! I can't wait to see what everyone finds out. See you all soon!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
